        <mxCell id="script-p1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF2F8;strokeColor=#002456;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;ConfigureRemotingForAnsible.ps1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• WinRM HTTPS listener initialization (Port 5986)&lt;br&gt;• Generates self-signed SSL / binds certificates&lt;br&gt;• Configures local Windows Firewall rules&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
